<title>UK: Kingfisher up as Morgan Stanley repeats buy.</title>
<headline>Kingfisher up as Morgan Stanley repeats buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Kingfisher Plc advanced on Monday amid a flat to weaker retail sector as brokerage Morgan Stanley reiterated its &quot;strong buy&quot; recommendation on the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 0942 GMT, the shares were up 7-1/2p to 684-1/2.</p>
